print("1. The quantum walk evolves using probability amplitudes.")
print("2. The Hadamard coin and conditional shift control its evolution.")
print("3. Quantum interference changes the final probability distribution.")
print("4. The classical walk uses random left/right movements.")
print("5. Variance helps compare how the distributions spread.")

print("\nNote: This is a mathematical simulation using NumPy.")
print("It does not execute a quantum circuit on actual quantum hardware.")
